          "explanation": "Statements 1 and 2 are correct; Statement 3 is incorrect.\n• Statement 1 is correct: Section 176(3) of the BNSS mandates compulsory forensic crime-scene investigation for offences punishable with 7 years or more imprisonment.\n• Statement 2 is correct: Section 4 of the BNS adds Community Service as one of the six statutory punishments.\n• Statement 3 is incorrect: Article 20(1) prohibits ex-post-facto criminal legislation; hence offences committed before July 1, 2024 continue to be governed by the erstwhile IPC, 1860.",
